---
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1 class="hero-title reveal" data-od-id="hero-headline">
        Visibility drives revenue for
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-roll reveal">
        <span class="dropping-texts" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="dropping-texts__item">founders</span>
          <span class="dropping-texts__item">SMB owners</span>
          <span class="dropping-texts__item">fractional executives</span>
          <span class="dropping-texts__item">consultants</span>
          <span class="dropping-texts__sizer">fractional executives</span>
        </span>
        <span class="sr-only">founders, SMB owners, fractional executives, and consultants.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="hero-sub reveal" data-od-id="hero-subhead">
        Building reputational authority shouldn’t burn 10 hours a week or cost a $5,000/month
        ghostwriter. Just record your raw train of thought whenever inspiration strikes. Crucible
        turns your exact words into short video clips, carousel slides, deep-dive videos, and
        ready-to-publish posts.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas reveal">
        <a class="btn btn--fin" href="https://app.trycrucible.com/login" data-od-id="hero-cta-primary">Capture Your First Brain Dump</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="#comparison">Compare Your Options</a>
      </div>
      <p class="microtrust reveal">No credit card · No charge for your first project · No watermarks</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-media reveal">
      <img
        src="/hero-studio.png"
        alt="Crucible studio — turn one brain-dump recording into a week of clips, carousels, posts, and articles"
        width="860"
        height="743"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    --hero-display: clamp(1.6rem, 11vw - 6px, 3.5rem);
    --hero-leading: 0.95;
    --hero-roll-gap: calc(0.25 * var(--hero-leading) * var(--hero-display));
    padding: 72px 0 96px;
    border-top: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--hero-display);
    font-weight: 430;
    line-height: var(--hero-leading);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .hero-roll {
    margin: var(--hero-roll-gap) 0;
    font-size: var(--hero-display);
    font-weight: 430;
    line-height: var(--hero-leading);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--fin);
  }

  .dropping-texts {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .dropping-texts__sizer {
    visibility: hidden;
  }

  .dropping-texts__item {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .dropping-texts__item:nth-child(1) {
    animation: hero-roll 12s linear infinite 0s;
  }

  .dropping-texts__item:nth-child(2) {
    animation: hero-roll 12s linear infinite 3s;
  }

  .dropping-texts__item:nth-child(3) {
    animation: hero-roll 12s linear infinite 6s;
  }

  .dropping-texts__item:nth-child(4) {
    animation: hero-roll 12s linear infinite 9s;
  }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: -1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @keyframes hero-roll {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    4% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    20% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    24% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .hero-sub {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-60);
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .microtrust {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-50);
  }

  .hero-media {
    border: 1px solid var(--oat);
    border-radius: var(--radius-container);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-media img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .dropping-texts__item {
      animation: none !important;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: none;
    }

    .dropping-texts__item:first-child {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 48px 0 80px;
    }
  }
</style>
